⍝ lib/bounded.imo — spec notation — trusted prelude, part 4: bounded quantifiers over lists (unbounded quantifiers are not decidable and are not provided)
∀ₗ ∶ (α → 𝔹) → 𝔏 α → 𝔹
∀ₗ ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ω ↦ (∧ (ξ ζ) (∀ₗ ξ ω))) ⊤)
∃ₗ ∶ (α → 𝔹) → 𝔏 α → 𝔹
∃ₗ ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ω ↦ (∨ (ξ ζ) (∃ₗ ξ ω))) ⊥)
⍳′ ∶ ℕ → ℕ → 𝔏 ℕ
⍳′ ξ η ≔ ((⩾ η ξ) ⊘ (∷ η (⍳′ ξ (⊞ η 1))))
⍳ ∶ ℕ → 𝔏 ℕ
⍳ ξ ≔ (⍳′ ξ 0)
